# The Paladin's first class node: three GMS effects merged into one number. GMS
# puts an echo on a party member, who then copies the Paladin's attacks, and
# gives three separate final damage shares for it: 75% to the Paladin, 40% more
# through the echo, and 15% more while Divine Blessing is on whoever carries it.
# Final damage multiplies here as in GMS, so 1.75 x 1.40 x 1.15 is one buff of
# 181.75%, which says the same thing.
#
# The blessing's share is the only part that needs company: it pays for the
# blessing on whoever carries the echo, and alone nobody carries it. The other
# two are unconditional; this game's Divine Blessing is a permanent passive with
# nothing to aim, so the blessing is never what is missing.
#
# Both steps are rounded instead of the exact ladder between GMS's ends, which
# would need 1.5517 and 0.3448 points a level. Max level matches GMS to the
# hundredth on both; level 1 is 1.5 over on the first and 0.15 under on the
# second.
#
# The echo itself gives one other member 100% Buff Duration, permanently instead
# of on this skill's timer: a 30-second buff on a 60-second cooldown can't
# lengthen someone else's buffs for only half the time, since there is one
# duration per fight. GMS's 50-65% plus 1% per 1000 STR, capped at 100%, is
# rounded up to the cap it heads for.
#
# Dropped: everything GMS's description is about: choosing the member by number
# key, losing the echo when they move out of range, and not being able to echo a
# Paladin who is already echoing someone.
name: "Divine Echo"
description:
  "Grants an echo of your battle prowess that mirrors your attack skills "
  "alongside you. Increases your Final Damage, and one party member's Buff "
  "Duration."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_PALADIN_V skill_order: 1 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
base_delay_ms: 120
cooldown_seconds: 60.0
ally_base { buff_duration_pct: 1.00 }
ally_grant_reaches_one: true
buff {
  duration_seconds: 15.5
  duration_seconds_per_level: 0.5
  base { final_dmg_pct: 1.015 }
  per_level { final_dmg_pct: 0.015 }
  with_party_base { final_dmg_pct: 0.0485 }
  with_party_per_level { final_dmg_pct: 0.0035 }
}
